1
00:00:12,897 --> 00:00:14,106
<c.simplifiedchinese>卖糖的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:14,192 --> 00:00:15,318
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们买点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:15,903 --> 00:00:17,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>要一份糖</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:37,738 --> 00:00:41,117
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:01:58,859 --> 00:02:01,403
<c.simplifiedchinese>好几年没做萩饼了</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:02:07,208 --> 00:02:08,710
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:02:08,795 --> 00:02:09,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:02:10,299 --> 00:02:13,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>萩饼无论谁做都很好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:02:13,513 --> 00:02:14,598
<c.simplifiedchinese>那倒未必</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:02:14,682 --> 00:02:18,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前薰小姐做过一次
吃起来像泥巴球…</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:02:19,358 --> 00:02:22,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>-哦啰…
-少多嘴</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:02:22,364 --> 00:02:25,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是暴力的小姑娘呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:02:26,289 --> 00:02:29,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>抛弃她 然后投入我的怀抱如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:02:30,297 --> 00:02:33,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐…</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:02:36,309 --> 00:02:39,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>稍微松懈一点 你马上就这样！</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:02:39,189 --> 00:02:42,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟你说过吧
敢对剑心出手就把你扫地出门！</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:02:42,237 --> 00:02:45,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 选择喜欢谁是他的自由</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:02:46,412 --> 00:02:49,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>你每次都这样责难我</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:02:49,251 --> 00:02:51,711
<c.simplifiedchinese>只能暴露你对自己的不自信</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:02:52,716 --> 00:02:57,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>不甘心的话
不如学学怎么把萩饼做得好吃</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:02:57,935 --> 00:02:59,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是没话反驳</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:01,149 --> 00:03:03,277
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为她会变得更娴静点</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:03,363 --> 00:03:05,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到还是一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:05,659 --> 00:03:10,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是她比以前更开朗更有活力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:11,169 --> 00:03:12,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>是好事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:12,381 --> 00:03:13,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>哪里好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:13,842 --> 00:03:16,886
<c.simplifiedchinese>一大早你们在吵吵闹闹说什么呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:16,973 --> 00:03:18,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:18,350 --> 00:03:20,519
<c.simplifiedchinese>老头看过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:20,606 --> 00:03:24,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>市面上流通的确实是新型鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:25,616 --> 00:03:26,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:29,331 --> 00:03:31,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>吃过早饭了吗？要不要来点？</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:31,878 --> 00:03:32,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必了</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:33,506 --> 00:03:38,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>我宁愿吃小姑娘做的
也不吃这个鸦片女做的食物</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:42,399 --> 00:03:44,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>我昨晚一夜没睡</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:44,737 --> 00:03:47,823
<c.simplifiedchinese>一会找个房间睡觉
中午记得叫我起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:47,910 --> 00:03:49,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>给我站住！</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:49,747 --> 00:03:51,916
<c.simplifiedchinese>说了那么过分的话
不能就这样走了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:52,001 --> 00:03:53,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>算了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:54,632 --> 00:03:57,093
<c.simplifiedchinese>惠小姐 请别往心里去</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:58,682 --> 00:04:01,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>他知道你是做鸦片的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:01,938 --> 00:04:04,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>但同时也了解了你的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:04,860 --> 00:04:07,321
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想责怪你但是又做不到</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:08,451 --> 00:04:10,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>除此之外</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:10,455 --> 00:04:12,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一周没有听到观柳的行动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:14,170 --> 00:04:15,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>他挥起了拳头</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:15,256 --> 00:04:18,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>又不知道该怎么做</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:18,805 --> 00:04:21,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以心里难免有点烦躁</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:22,688 --> 00:04:25,107
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他一点时间吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:29,242 --> 00:04:31,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,168
<c.simplifiedchinese>你好</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:34,252 --> 00:04:36,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>多谢你们照顾我生意</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:36,799 --> 00:04:38,301
<c.simplifiedchinese>我是租书人</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:38,385 --> 00:04:40,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>最近入手了很多新书</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:40,974 --> 00:04:42,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>-要看看吗？
-嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:43,772 --> 00:04:46,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>小姑娘 最近经常看到你呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:46,986 --> 00:04:49,238
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚搬到这里吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:49,324 --> 00:04:52,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>不 我只是暂住…</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:52,455 --> 00:04:53,956
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:56,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>那真是太好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:57,841 --> 00:04:59,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>别出声</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:04:59,469 --> 00:05:02,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>挣扎的话 就用这个把你扔到井里</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:02,935 --> 00:05:04,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>水银！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:04,312 --> 00:05:07,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳有话跟你说</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:08,028 --> 00:05:10,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>麻烦你走一趟</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:16,336 --> 00:05:17,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么话想说？</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:19,467 --> 00:05:22,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不说你也知道吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:22,265 --> 00:05:25,101
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多该回来了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:25,730 --> 00:05:28,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起回到你那 我宁愿去死</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:28,945 --> 00:05:30,613
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:31,116 --> 00:05:32,993
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要是不回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:33,955 --> 00:05:36,583
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就火烧神谷道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:37,713 --> 00:05:42,384
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的私兵团、御庭番众、附近的黑道</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:42,471 --> 00:05:44,682
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约五百人把道场团团包围</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:44,768 --> 00:05:49,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>连只老鼠都逃不出去 然后放火</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:50,529 --> 00:05:54,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>“杜鹃不啼 则杀之”</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:57,501 --> 00:06:00,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候放弃幻想了吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:01,259 --> 00:06:02,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>你做的鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:02,261 --> 00:06:06,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>害死了那么多人 是不容质疑的事实</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:06,144 --> 00:06:08,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算再见到你的家人</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:08,565 --> 00:06:13,487
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷家的女儿竟然做出这种事
他们知道了会怎么想？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:13,993 --> 00:06:17,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在逃跑也没什么意义了</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:17,500 --> 00:06:21,921
<c.simplifiedchinese>你、我还有鸦片都在同一条船上</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:22,426 --> 00:06:24,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后也是一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:25,809 --> 00:06:29,312
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 今晚零点火烧道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:29,399 --> 00:06:33,528
<c.simplifiedchinese>时间不多了 好好考虑抓紧决定吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:33,615 --> 00:06:34,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:38,625 --> 00:06:41,420
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得那个女人会回来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:41,924 --> 00:06:44,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是她不回来就麻烦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:44,429 --> 00:06:50,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个带着刀疤的男人
就是传奇刽子手绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:50,232 --> 00:06:55,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起用强 避免跟他冲突更加明智</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:55,910 --> 00:06:59,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠自愿离开</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:59,542 --> 00:07:04,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样拔刀斋也就没有理由插手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:05,596 --> 00:07:07,681
<c.simplifiedchinese>理由吗…</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:10,689 --> 00:07:12,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>我逃不掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:12,903 --> 00:07:14,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃离不了观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:14,572 --> 00:07:15,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>逃离不了鸦片</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:16,786 --> 00:07:18,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>这一辈子都逃脱不了</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:21,336 --> 00:07:22,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>鸦片女…</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:27,139 --> 00:07:28,182
<c.simplifiedchinese>敬启者</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:28,266 --> 00:07:32,396
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然很任性 但请原谅我的不告而别</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:38,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳和他的手下似乎已经放弃了
我也是时候回会津了</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:39,372 --> 00:07:43,292
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你们过去十天对我的照顾</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:44,048 --> 00:07:47,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>“草草不能尽言 高荷惠”</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:47,555 --> 00:07:50,683
<c.simplifiedchinese>感觉有点伤心呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:52,356 --> 00:07:53,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>假的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:54,776
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:54,862 --> 00:07:58,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在会津根本没人在等惠小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:00,080 --> 00:08:03,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳的人一定趁我们不在威胁了她</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:06,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你知不知道观柳的宅邸在哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:06,301 --> 00:08:07,218
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:07,303 --> 00:08:08,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:08,805 --> 00:08:13,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么我要去救那个鸦片女？</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:13,523 --> 00:08:14,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:14,902 --> 00:08:17,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么时候开始总说这种丧气话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:17,908 --> 00:08:19,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了 阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:20,537 --> 00:08:22,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>一点也不像你</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:30,930
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的朋友啊 他在街上卖糖</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:31,726 --> 00:08:38,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>好赌博 但也喜欢买糖孩子的笑脸
是个草包 但人不坏</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:38,573 --> 00:08:42,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是就这样被她做的鸦片害死了</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:43,583 --> 00:08:47,379
<c.simplifiedchinese>我到底有什么理由去帮她？</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:47,466 --> 00:08:52,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不像你那么老好人 也不是浪客！</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:57,945 --> 00:09:02,992
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左 你没仔细看过惠小姐的眼神吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:03,081 --> 00:09:04,165
<c.simplifiedchinese>眼神？</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:04,834 --> 00:09:10,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>她表现得很坚强
但偶尔眼神里会流露出孤独</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:11,889 --> 00:09:12,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:13,852 --> 00:09:15,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>告诉观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:16,149 --> 00:09:19,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>高荷惠回来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:20,073 --> 00:09:25,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>她的眼神透露着
她渴望拥有家人一样可以信任的伙伴</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:26,044 --> 00:09:29,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果每个行动非要有特定的理由</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:29,842 --> 00:09:32,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个理由对在下来说就已经足够</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:36,105 --> 00:09:38,024
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 我也去</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:38,109 --> 00:09:39,736
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦 等等！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:39,820 --> 00:09:41,822
<c.simplifiedchinese>你去只会拖后腿的</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:41,908 --> 00:09:43,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:43,119 --> 00:09:45,872
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个女人救了我一命！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:45,957 --> 00:09:48,502
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算拼了这条命 我也要去救她</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:48,588 --> 00:09:52,342
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是我连这都做不到
还说什么“神谷活心流是救人剑”</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:09:57,063 --> 00:10:01,150
<c.simplifiedchinese>这孩子不知不觉间
也成长为一个真正的剑客了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:02,116 --> 00:10:04,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次可能要彻夜不归了</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:04,453 --> 00:10:08,499
<c.simplifiedchinese>别忘了准备好五人份的洗澡水和早饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:09,003 --> 00:10:10,422
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:12,886 --> 00:10:15,264
<c.simplifiedchinese>我决定不想那么多了</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:15,851 --> 00:10:19,354
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来拿出我的作风 去大闹一场</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:20,736 --> 00:10:21,570
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:22,948 --> 00:10:23,991
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:30,172 --> 00:10:32,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里就是观柳的宅邸</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:32,843 --> 00:10:34,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:34,555 --> 00:10:36,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>你准备怎么攻入？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:36,934 --> 00:10:39,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>人手稀少的奇袭要以速度取胜</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:10:39,774 --> 00:10:43,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>破开大门后全力冲到入口</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:10:43,656 --> 00:10:45,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是从正面进攻啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:10:45,827 --> 00:10:47,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>懂了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:10:47,539 --> 00:10:48,540
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:10:49,251 --> 00:10:51,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>可别落在我后面了 明白？</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:10:57,976 --> 00:10:59,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>-怎么了？
-看我的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:05,367 --> 00:11:07,536
<c.simplifiedchinese>欢迎回来 惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:07,621 --> 00:11:10,374
<c.simplifiedchinese>我就知道你一定会回来的</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:10,877 --> 00:11:14,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>毕竟除了这里 你无处可去</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:14,593 --> 00:11:18,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且蜘蛛网的存货快要卖光了</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:19,060 --> 00:11:20,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>快多做一点吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:24,070 --> 00:11:25,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是头疼啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:26,074 --> 00:11:28,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>你总是想着反抗</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:28,705 --> 00:11:32,333
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明这么可爱…</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:32,421 --> 00:11:36,758
<c.simplifiedchinese>你觉得可爱的
是我做的鸦片帮你获取的利润吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:37,264 --> 00:11:38,181
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:38,683 --> 00:11:42,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>赚来的利润让你显得格外可爱</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:43,025 --> 00:11:44,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:48,115
<c.simplifiedchinese>可惜 我回来不是帮你做鸦片的</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:48,620 --> 00:11:49,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:49,538 --> 00:11:52,750
<c.simplifiedchinese>武田观柳 我回来取你性命</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:54,298 --> 00:11:56,091
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:56,176 --> 00:11:58,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>你和我是同一条船上的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:11:58,348 --> 00:12:00,224
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀了你之后我会立刻自杀</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:01,896 --> 00:12:04,940
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不想再背负着罪孽活下去了</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:05,027 --> 00:12:07,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>一起坠入地狱吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:08,075 --> 00:12:12,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算是对因鸦片受苦的人赎罪了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:17,636 --> 00:12:19,012
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:19,682 --> 00:12:20,974
<c.simplifiedchinese>到此为止吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:26,027 --> 00:12:28,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:28,198 --> 00:12:29,324
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这臭女人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:31,664 --> 00:12:35,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>之前对那个大夫态度强硬失败了</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:35,337 --> 00:12:39,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以对你好一点 你竟敢蹬鼻子上脸</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:39,805 --> 00:12:42,683
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟敢小看我观柳大人！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:46,610 --> 00:12:48,195
<c.simplifiedchinese>召集私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,991
<c.simplifiedchinese>严刑拷问
让她吐出鸦片的制作方法！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:51,077 --> 00:12:53,705
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有人都在外面</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:53,791 --> 00:12:55,001
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:12:55,085 --> 00:12:56,587
<c.simplifiedchinese>听</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:12:58,008 --> 00:13:00,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…紧急集合哨</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:01,055 --> 00:13:02,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个男人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:02,893 --> 00:13:03,935
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:10,658 --> 00:13:12,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快…太快了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:12,913 --> 00:13:13,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>是人类吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:13,831 --> 00:13:15,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:15,375 --> 00:13:16,877
<c.simplifiedchinese>别给我分心啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:16,962 --> 00:13:18,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>会受伤的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:23,350 --> 00:13:24,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:13:25,187 --> 00:13:26,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么慢可不行啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:13:27,567 --> 00:13:29,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>小屁孩 胡说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:13:30,615 --> 00:13:31,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>好…好强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:13:31,992 --> 00:13:34,119
<c.simplifiedchinese>这两个人太强了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:13:34,205 --> 00:13:36,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>是三人组 蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:13:38,881 --> 00:13:41,509
<c.simplifiedchinese>私兵团和黑道大部分都收拾掉了</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:13:43,223 --> 00:13:44,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>火枪队！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:13:44,392 --> 00:13:45,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>瞄准！</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:13:45,979 --> 00:13:47,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>射…</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:13:50,530 --> 00:13:52,031
<c.simplifiedchinese>就现在！射击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:13:52,116 --> 00:13:53,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左！弥彦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:13:53,410 --> 00:13:55,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>-弥彦！
-在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:13:55,122 --> 00:13:56,665
<c.simplifiedchinese>轮到你出场了</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:13:56,750 --> 00:13:59,003
<c.simplifiedchinese>给他们点颜色看！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:01,092 --> 00:14:02,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小鬼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:04,181 --> 00:14:06,601
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在找这把枪吗 大叔？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:07,772 --> 00:14:10,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>扒手技能竟然在这派上了用场</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:10,945 --> 00:14:14,449
<c.simplifiedchinese>人生真是充满了奇遇啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:14:15,370 --> 00:14:16,538
<c.simplifiedchinese>砰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:14:18,669 --> 00:14:19,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:14:19,796 --> 00:14:21,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>你以为我会开枪吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:14:21,759 --> 00:14:23,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>我可是剑客</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:14:23,763 --> 00:14:25,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>我才不用什么枪呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:14:26,059 --> 00:14:27,268
<c.simplifiedchinese>臭小子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:14:27,353 --> 00:14:28,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>少得意忘形！</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:14:29,900 --> 00:14:30,776
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:14:31,946 --> 00:14:33,781
<c.simplifiedchinese>还好吗 弥彦？</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:14:33,866 --> 00:14:36,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:14:36,246 --> 00:14:39,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在叫我回去 我也不会回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:14:39,126 --> 00:14:41,128
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 就是这股志气</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:14:41,214 --> 00:14:43,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>可别落后了 弥彦</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:14:43,510 --> 00:14:44,636
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:14:44,721 --> 00:14:48,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这家伙
刚才怎么突然就把我扔出去了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:14:49,063 --> 00:14:51,190
<c.simplifiedchinese>我这是给你创造出场机会</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:14:51,276 --> 00:14:53,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>你该感谢我才对</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:14:53,113 --> 00:14:54,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:14:55,033 --> 00:14:56,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:14:56,536 --> 00:14:59,706
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋到底有什么理由…</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:14:59,793 --> 00:15:04,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了那个女人追到这里
究竟有什么好处？</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:15:04,218 --> 00:15:08,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋不是在乎得失的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:15:08,644 --> 00:15:11,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>否则他现在早就是陆军军官了</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:15:13,069 --> 00:15:15,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种生意人不会明白的</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:15:15,950 --> 00:15:17,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然跟我们立场不同</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:15:17,912 --> 00:15:24,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>但维新志士和我们一样
都是愿意为了信仰赴死的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:15:25,052 --> 00:15:30,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>如今这个世道
许多维新志士已经腐化堕落</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:15:31,064 --> 00:15:33,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他似乎仍然过的不错</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:38,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然引出了十年未曾现身的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:15:39,288 --> 00:15:44,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个男人就是我们
江户城御庭番众的猎物</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:15:44,382 --> 00:15:46,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>开…开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:15:46,636 --> 00:15:50,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>与传说中的刽子手为敌
实在太危险了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:15:50,560 --> 00:15:51,895
<c.simplifiedchinese>别那么说</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:15:52,606 --> 00:15:54,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们很想和他一战</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:15:58,953 --> 00:16:00,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:16:00,288 --> 00:16:01,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候赎罪了</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:16:01,917 --> 00:16:04,044
<c.simplifiedchinese>带着惠小姐下来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:16:10,350 --> 00:16:11,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是？</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:16:11,812 --> 00:16:13,355
<c.simplifiedchinese>吓到精神错乱了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:16:15,402 --> 00:16:17,195
<c.simplifiedchinese>非常精彩！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:16:17,281 --> 00:16:21,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>一口气就解决了我的五十多个私兵</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:16:21,247 --> 00:16:25,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>不愧是传说中的刽子手绯村拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:16:25,130 --> 00:16:28,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙…知道剑心的过去…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:16:28,219 --> 00:16:30,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕御庭番众早就查过了</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:16:30,474 --> 00:16:32,267
<c.simplifiedchinese>精彩绝伦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:16:32,352 --> 00:16:37,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>有了御庭番众
你再加入我麾下 那就真的无敌了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:16:37,446 --> 00:16:40,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>我付给你五十份私兵的工资！</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:16:40,870 --> 00:16:43,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>如何？做我的保镖吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:16:43,918 --> 00:16:46,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>下来还是不下来</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:16:46,464 --> 00:16:47,340
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底怎样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:16:48,426 --> 00:16:50,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我付一百人份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:16:51,892 --> 00:16:53,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…二百人份！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:16:53,728 --> 00:16:55,480
<c.simplifiedchinese>你还不明白</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:16:55,983 --> 00:16:58,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不能用金钱收买</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:16:59,657 --> 00:17:03,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过了
绯村拔刀斋不会为利益所动</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:17:05,293 --> 00:17:06,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:17:06,504 --> 00:17:09,048
<c.simplifiedchinese>我懂了 是我输了</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:17:09,134 --> 00:17:10,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>我投降！</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:17:10,345 --> 00:17:12,138
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会交出高荷惠的</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:17:12,224 --> 00:17:14,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>但给我一个小时时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:17:14,980 --> 00:17:17,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有许多准备要做 求你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:17:18,027 --> 00:17:20,280
<c.simplifiedchinese>就在那里等着</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:17:20,365 --> 00:17:23,410
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的鬼话谁信啊 混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:17:27,754 --> 00:17:29,923
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！等等！</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:17:30,010 --> 00:17:32,095
<c.simplifiedchinese>轻信别人也该有个度！</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:17:32,180 --> 00:17:33,432
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:17:33,516 --> 00:17:35,518
<c.simplifiedchinese>趁这一个小时对高荷惠严加拷问</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:17:35,604 --> 00:17:39,733
<c.simplifiedchinese>逼出蜘蛛网的制作方法 她就没用了</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:17:39,820 --> 00:17:42,197
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不信她能坚持那么久</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:18:03,785 --> 00:18:06,371
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个小时内我会杀上去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:18:06,457 --> 00:18:08,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>做好准备吧 观柳！</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:18:10,715 --> 00:18:13,510
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的权宜之计只是火上浇油</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:18:14,014 --> 00:18:16,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此 他果然是个性情中人</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:18:16,936 --> 00:18:20,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>首…首领…让御庭番众做好准备</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:18:20,360 --> 00:18:21,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经准备好了</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:18:22,948 --> 00:18:25,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>连接着入口的走廊</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:18:25,286 --> 00:18:26,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>以及走廊尽头的台阶上</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:18:27,541 --> 00:18:29,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>安排了我的左膀右臂</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:18:30,672 --> 00:18:33,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>我则负责在舞厅殿后</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:18:33,886 --> 00:18:35,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>可以</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:18:35,181 --> 00:18:38,977
<c.simplifiedchinese>别再安排恶见和火男
那种没用的垃圾！</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:18:39,064 --> 00:18:44,153
<c.simplifiedchinese>领着那么高的薪水却名不副实
我绝不能轻饶</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:18:45,452 --> 00:18:49,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说“绝不能轻饶”是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:18:50,670 --> 00:18:52,172
<c.simplifiedchinese>别搞错了</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:18:52,924 --> 00:18:55,552
<c.simplifiedchinese>御庭番众听从的不是你的命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:18:56,265 --> 00:18:58,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是我的</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:18:58,853 --> 00:19:01,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝不允许有人瞧不起他们</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:19:05,658 --> 00:19:07,952
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们的目标是高荷惠</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:19:08,790 --> 00:19:11,918
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会把她关在三楼的观景台</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:19:12,631 --> 00:19:17,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别再插手了
留在这清算你的财产吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:19:31,460 --> 00:19:32,878
<c.simplifiedchinese>你醒了</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:19:32,963 --> 00:19:34,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:19:34,341 --> 00:19:35,801
<c.simplifiedchinese>观景台？</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:19:35,885 --> 00:19:37,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>究竟…</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:19:37,430 --> 00:19:41,476
<c.simplifiedchinese>神谷道场的人打来了 想把你带回去</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:19:41,564 --> 00:19:42,690
<c.simplifiedchinese>骗人…</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:19:42,774 --> 00:19:44,317
<c.simplifiedchinese>我何必骗你？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:19:44,820 --> 00:19:47,489
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们已经消灭了私兵团</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:19:49,078 --> 00:19:49,954
<c.simplifiedchinese>笨蛋</c.simplifiedchinese>

317
00:19:50,038 --> 00:19:53,208
<c.simplifiedchinese>明明我都自己离开了 他们还是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

318
00:19:53,713 --> 00:19:54,922
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

319
00:19:55,007 --> 00:19:59,928
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么神谷道场这群人
一个两个都这么傻？</c.simplifiedchinese>

320
00:20:02,480 --> 00:20:04,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的短刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

321
00:20:04,150 --> 00:20:05,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>还给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

322
00:20:06,154 --> 00:20:08,364
<c.simplifiedchinese>最好别抱什么希望</c.simplifiedchinese>

323
00:20:08,868 --> 00:20:11,245
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们不可能打上来</c.simplifiedchinese>

324
00:20:11,916 --> 00:20:16,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>一个小时后等待你的不是拯救
而是观柳的拷问</c.simplifiedchinese>

325
00:20:16,759 --> 00:20:20,137
<c.simplifiedchinese>是痛苦的死 还是安乐的死</c.simplifiedchinese>

326
00:20:20,808 --> 00:20:23,227
<c.simplifiedchinese>自己选吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

327
00:20:23,731 --> 00:20:28,527
<c.simplifiedchinese>观柳想要的鸦片和钱 我们都不在乎</c.simplifiedchinese>

328
00:20:29,660 --> 00:20:33,372
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们御庭番众渴望的只是战斗本身</c.simplifiedchinese>

329
00:20:34,001 --> 00:20:37,713
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此才来替这个走私鸦片的商人卖命</c.simplifiedchinese>

330
00:20:38,218 --> 00:20:41,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>多亏了你 现在有了最强的对手</c.simplifiedchinese>

331
00:20:41,182 --> 00:20:42,934
<c.simplifiedchinese>这算是谢礼</c.simplifiedchinese>

332
00:20:44,146 --> 00:20:47,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>我虽然有一点同情你的悲惨人生经历</c.simplifiedchinese>

333
00:20:47,904 --> 00:20:50,991
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那种事怎样都无所谓</c.simplifiedchinese>

334
00:21:00,053 --> 00:21:01,722
<c.simplifiedchinese>我很震惊</c.simplifiedchinese>

335
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:05,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>打头阵的竟然是你这样的高手</c.simplifiedchinese>

336
00:21:05,523 --> 00:21:07,817
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过</c.simplifiedchinese>

337
00:21:07,902 --> 00:21:11,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必着急 我们总有一天会分出胜负</c.simplifiedchinese>

338
00:22:47,977 --> 00:22:51,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集
《壮烈的般若 疮痍的式尉》</c.simplifiedchinese>

